@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Session persistence and logout
state "Unauthenticated" as Guest
state "Authenticated session" as Active
state "Session invalidated" as Ended
[*] --> Guest
Guest --> Active : successful registration/login as specified
Guest --> Guest : invalid login; protected access rejected
Active --> Active : valid subsequent request; same identity
Active --> Ended : logout
Ended --> Guest : protected request requires authentication
note bottom of Active : Persistence is verified across valid requests
note bottom of Ended : Arbitrary long-duration expiry is not implied by this test scope
@enduml
